      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know they're old but it's just a tiny splash... i'm just worried about the chemicals sitting in there. if i use the drops, won't that help clear the irritation or at least protect me in case it's stinging because of a tiny scratch or something? it seems easier than having to go to the doctor for something this small.",
