      "content": "okay i get it, but honestly i don't really have time to go to a doctor right now and the redness isn't even getting much worse. if i just do a quick rinse with water and then put the drops in to keep it clean, would that be okay as a middle ground? i just really want to avoid an eye infection if the detergent caused a tiny nick or something.",
